{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06614","headline":"同王十三维哭殷遥 · 储光羲","name":"同王十三维哭殷遥","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"生理无不尽，念君在中年。\n游道虽未深，举世莫能贤。\n筮仕苦贫贱，爲客少田园。\n膏腴不可求，乃在许西偏。\n四邻尽桑柘，咫尺开墙垣。\n内艰未及虞，形影随化迁。\n茅茨俯苫盖，双殡两楹间。\n时闻孤女号，逈出陌与阡。\n慈乌乱飞鸣，猛兽亦以跧。\n故人王夫子，静念无生篇。\n哀乐久已绝，闻之将泫然。\n太阳蔽空虚，雨雪浮苍山。\n迢遰亲灵榇，顾予悲绝弦。\n处顺与安时，及此乃空言。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"储光羲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06614.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06614","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}